  "reasoning": "The defendant stole numerous motorcycles, cash, clothing, jewelry, religious items, weapons, ammunition, and explosives, and sold many of these items for profit. The primary criminal conduct is theft (盗窃). Because the defendant concealed and disposed of the stolen property and profited from it, the charge of concealment of criminal proceeds (掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益) applies. Additionally, the defendant possessed military ammunition and explosives without authorization, which falls under illegal possession of firearms and ammunition (非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药). No other distinct offenses from the provided label list are evident.",
  "final_answer": "盗窃;掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益;非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药"
